'''I.M. Phace''' (カヲルさん, '''''Kaworu-san''''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[The Face]], first seen as the boss of [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1. He was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

